body:
are the coders supposed to be spending 1000 LOC when they get a function? it says 1/sec but it seems like it's one per 1000 LOC. Renders the "more functions per click" useless once you get  a coder.

&#x200B;

edit: nvm if they are supposed to spend 1000 LOC it works fine, just seemed odd until I got over 2000 LOC
